<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  UST cut to mkt perform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  UST cut to mkt perform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it had reduced its rating for UST Inc to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Greenwich, Conn., smokeless tobacco maker opened down 5/8 to 30-7/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
